It is getting late.
I want to go home.
This time I ask nobody.
I find an information board with a city map.
I look at the map.
I look for the way to the S-Bahn station.
I see the symbol for the S-Bahn.
It is a white S on a green sign.
I just have to follow these signs.
I see the first sign on the street.
I just go straight ahead.
Then I come to a small park.
The park is right by the river.
I walk past the park.
I keep walking straight ahead.
I already see the station ahead.
I go to the entrance.
I am glad.
Now I can travel home.
